<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Fishers' insurance proposals rejected by Hambros.</title>
<headline>Fishers' insurance proposals rejected by Hambros.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fishers International Plc on Tuesday confirmed that it had approached Hambros Plc with certain proposals regarding Hambros' majority shareholding in Hambros Insurance Services Plc.</p>
<p>In a statement responding to press speculation, Fishers said these proposals were not accepted by Hambros and Fishers is now reviewing the position.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
